      "description": "Get breaking sports news, follow your favourite teams and sports, check live scores, and catch up on the latest highlights from the biggest competitions. With a Sky Sports subscription, you can also watch the best live sport with access to all Sky Sports channels.\n\nFollow football, F1, cricket, boxing, golf, tennis, rugby league, rugby union, darts, NFL, racing, netball and more.\n\nMOMENTS\nA new personalised video reels experience featuring the biggest moments, stories and talking points from across Sky Sports.\n\nFOLLOW YOUR FAVOURITES\nAdd your favourite teams and sports to your home screen for quick access to the live streams, news and videos that matter most to you.\n\nVIDEO STORIES\nCatch up on Premier League and WSL action with Video Stories, a fast and easy way to watch the latest match highlights, key moments and updates.\n\nWATCH SKY SPORTS LIVE\nGot a Sky Sports subscription? Watch the biggest sporting events live with access to every Sky Sports channel, plus additional streams, all within the app. Enjoy coverage of the Premier League, EFL, WSL, SPFL, F1, US Open Tennis, ATP & WTA Tours, Super League, Lions Tour, The Open, The Masters, NFL, IPL, The Hundred, Premier League Darts, Netball and more.\n\nRide onboard with our F1 driver cameras, switch between multiple tennis matches, or watch key football moments while following the action live. Get closer to the sport than ever before, only in the Sky Sports app.\n\nIf you're with Sky Mobile, you can stream on the Sky Sports app without using your mobile data*.\n\nHIGHLIGHTS\nWatch an unbeatable selection of videos, including match highlights, news, interviews and analysis, for free within the Sky Sports app.\n\nLIVE SCORES\nStay up to date with live scores for football, cricket, tennis, rugby league and rugby union, plus live F1 timing across every Grand Prix session.\n\nPlease note:\nLive streaming and selected videos are only available in the UK and Ireland. Additional mobile network and/or WiFi charges may apply.\n\nTo learn more about how Sky uses your data, see our privacy notice at https://www.sky.com/help/articles/privacy-hub-home\n\nPlease read the terms and conditions carefully before using the app.\n\n*Requires an active Sky Mobile airtime plan and at least 50MB of data. See the Sky website for more information.",
